V21_email	-	1	Hilltop Estate caters for weddings and events of up to 70 guests. We offer flexible spaces for intimate ceremonies through to celebrations at full capacity. Get in touch with our team to discuss your vision and we'll tailor the perfect setup for your day. Contact us on 1300 912 765 or via our Contact page.
